 "strings": {
  "This can't be happening...": "",
  "This... can't be happening...": "",
  "Is this some kinda sick joke?\nWho would do something like this...?": "",
  "The cops'll definitely think I did it...\nNobody's gonna believe me!": "",
  "The cops'll think I did this for sure...\nNobody's gonna believe me!": "",
  "You're, uh...\nnot looking so hot, man.": "",
  "Criminal suits are a constant test\nof your conviction. Your sense of justice.": "",
  "This is the right floor, yeah?\nThe skyway'll take us to the research wing.": "",
  "But you're still going to plead innocent, yes?\nEven though Okubo-san is the one who'll suffer for it?": "",
  "O-Oh, really?": "",
  "Apparently a \"smart\" lawyer would never even consider\nan innocent plea in this case.": "",
  "Guess it's a good thing that I'm not so smart, then...\nbecause I honestly believe I can win.": "",
  "Please, Yagami-san.\nYou need to help Okubo-kun.": "",
  "You need to help Okubo-kun, Yagami-san.": "",
  "...And my brother, too.\nHe's stubborn, but he means well.": "",
  "And... my brother, too.\nHe's stubborn, but he means well.": "",
  "Just now, I...\nI heard Emi talking to me.": "",
  "It felt too real to just be my imagination.\nDid you notice anything?": "",
  "I can tell you all about it later.\nWe've got work to do.": "",
  "Yeah, but... Let's save that for now.\nWe've got work to do.": "",
  "It's time we stop Kuroiwa\nonce and for all.": "",
  "Come on.\nWe're going to stop Kuroiwa.": "",
  "Right. ...Huh. Whatever that fog over you was,\nit looks like it's cleared.": "",
  "Right.\nYou feeling better then?": "",
  "Use the keycard.\nY'know, the gold one.": "",
  "Hey! Hey you!": "",
  "It's high time you pay\nall the rent you owe!": "",
  "I just need a little longer, okay?": "",
  "Just one more week!": "",
  "Another week!?\nI am done warning you!": "",
  "Yes, I assure you!": "",
  "It better be!\nBye for now, then!": "",
  "Whew, that was close.": "",
  "Got it. I'll be right there.": "",
  "A-Aniki! U-Um...\nHelp me out here...": "",
  "A-Aniki! U-Um...\nIt's them again...": "",
  "The fuck are you?": "",
  "Who the hell are you!?": "",
  "Get lost, pal!": "",
  "Get lost!": "",
  "He's out of our league, man...": "",
  "This guy's a beast...": "",
  "Tch, let's move!": "",
  "Tch, let's go!": "",
  "Thank you so much, aniki!": "",
  "Anytime.": "",
  "(He watches out for his boys.\nHe's not all bad.)": "",
  "Hey! Watch it!": "",
  "Ow! Be careful!": "",
  "I'm so sorry!": "",
  "I-I'm sorry!": "",
  "(Oh, nice. One disappeared.)": "",
  "(Oh, another one left...\nEventually it'll be just Higashi, I suppose.)": "",
  "Hey, how about a few drinks tonight?": "",
  "Would you like to come play?": "",
  "N-No, I'm in a hurry...": "",
  "N-No, I'm in a hurry, so...": "",
  "I understand.\nI'll be right there!": "",
  "Yes, I understand.\nI'll get over there immediately!": "",
  "You know... I've been meaning to tell you\nthis for a little while, and...": "",
  "There's something I've been\nmeaning to tell you.": "",
  "I realized just how important you've been...\nthis whole time to me.": "",
  "You know, the more I spend\ntime with you...": "",
  "We've been through so much. It feels like...\nWe've known each other for such a long time now.": "",
  "The more I realize how\nimportant you are to me.": "",
  "I uhm...": "",
  "Well, I guess I just gotta say it!\nAre you ready?": "",
  "I wanted to say I love you!": "",
  "I love you... and the only thing I want\nis for us to be together!": "",
  "And...\nI'd like to be your girlfriend!": "",
  "There... I said it...": "",
  "Well. Here I go.": "",
  "Okay. Here goes.": "",
  "I know... this might seem sudden...\nBut I still gotta ask you anyway.": "",
  "Yagami-san.\nI have another favor to ask.": "",
  "From here on out, maybe you and I could see\neach other more...? If that's okay.": "",
  "Would it be okay\nif we kept seeing each other?": "",
  "I really have been wanting to get to know you a little more.\nIt's nice... that what I hoped for actually came true.": "",
  "I'm not talking anything work-related, either.\nI just want to spend some time with you.": "",
  "And... I feel like there's something else\nI need to tell you.": "",
  "Maybe I should make myself more clear.": "",
  "Okay, so... the reason I'm applying...\nI mean, what I'm trying to say...": "",
  "The reason I'm applying—\nI mean, the reason I'm saying all this...": "",
  "I realized that, out of every single guy I know,\nyou're the only one I've ever been in love with!": "",
  "It's because I want to make more memories together!\nAnd share new experiences!": "",
  "So yeah...\nIf you want me, then...": "",
  "And also...": "",
  "I'm all yours.": "",
  "I want to show you my love.": "",
  "I've discovered an even greater power\nthan predicting people's fortunes.": "",
  "Yagami-san. I've discovered a power\nfar greater than that of my predictions:": "",
  "What I'm referring to is...\nthe power of our relationship.": "",
  "That would be the power of our relationship.": "",
  "And if I may be honest...": "",
  "And if I may be so forward...": "",
  "I've become...\nquite enamored with you.": "",
  "I've become quite enamored with you.": "",
  "So, if you'll have me...": "",
  "I want to be your...\nyour special partner from here on, okay?": "",
  "I'd like you to be my special partner. ❤": "",
  "Yagami-san. Do you have any idea\nwhy I'm so upset?": "",
  "Do you <font_kind=yakuza_italic>really</font_kind> understand just how much you hurt me!?": "",
  "I thought I could trust you, you know! I honestly thought you\nwere going to be different from all the other guys out there.": "",
  "All you did was prove my point\nabout how selfish guys are!": "",
  "I might be overreacting, but... ": "",
  "...How they never even stop\nto consider our side of things.": "",
  "Can you even imagine? It's so wrong!\nFalling for someone who tricks you? That's messed up!": "",
  "It's even worse because I've\nfallen head over heels for you!": "",
  "If you're going to talk like you care about me,\nyou need to act like you mean it!": "",
  "If you really love me back,\nthen you'll need to prove it!": "",
  "You can do that by... being honest.\n No more lies or keeping secrets from me, okay?": "",
  "Promise you'll be faithful...\nAnd never lie to me again!": "",
  "(I suppose I should check out the outdoor unit...)": "",
  "(Maybe I should give up and check the heater.)": "",
  "(I don't have time for this right now...)": "",
  "(I can't keep hanging around here. Gotta get moving.)": "",
  "(Doesn't look like anyone's in here.)": "",
  "(I need to find Murase.)": "",
  "(I have to take advantage of Kaito's diversion.)": "",
  "(I have to rescue Seiya's sister while they're distracted.)": "",
  "(Yes, got it open.)": "",
  "(Wait... Did I put the code in wrong?)": "",
  "(It's dangerous when it's this dark.)": "",
  "(Hard to move around, too. Gotta find the lights.)": "",
  "(Shono's lab has to be in this abandoned building somewhere. Gotta find it.)": "",
  "(I can't turn back now. Gotta keep moving.)": "",
  "(It'd be too risky to try and go back down now.)": "",
  "(The code might be 8919. Time to give it a try.)": "",
  "(The code might be 708. Time to give it a try.)": "",
  "(The code might be either 8919 or 708. Time to give 'em a try.)": "",
  "(No idea what the code is, but I can try pushing some buttons.)": "",
  "(No sign of Murase here. Gotta keep moving.)": ""
 },
